    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"just existence\" though. it feels like being haunted. i'm walking around in a body that's just a constant, heavy reminder of everything i lost. it's like the real me is already gone, and this thing just... lingers. it's exhausting to keep carrying around something that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
